<section class="prose">
  <h2>What this site collects</h2>
  <p>I count visits with <a href="https://www.goatcounter.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GoatCounter</a>, which doesn't use cookies and doesn't store anything that identifies you. It records things like which page was viewed, the site that sent you here, your browser and screen size, and roughly which country you're in. I use it to see what people actually read and look at.</p>
  <p>Your browser remembers whether you chose light or dark mode, and English or Welsh. That stays on your device and never reaches me.</p>
  <p>There's no cookie banner because there are no cookies to agree to.</p>

  <h2>Other services</h2>
  <p>The photo map loads from MapTiler and MapLibre only when you open it, so, like any website, they see your IP address. If you subscribe to <em>Grounded</em>, your email goes straight to Substack and is covered by <a href="https://substack.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">their privacy policy</a>. It never passes through this site. Fonts and photos are all served from here.</p>
  <p>If you email me, I'll only use your address to reply.</p>

  <h2>Using my work</h2>
  <p>The photographs and writing on this site are mine. Please don't reuse, edit or sell them without asking first. If you'd like to use a photo (for a feature, a print or anything else), get in touch: I'm usually happy to talk. Sharing a link is always fine.</p>

  <h2 id="contact">Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about any of this, or want something taken down? Email <a data-mail href="/privacy/#contact"><span data-mail-text>me [at] marzooq [dot] co [dot] uk</span></a>.</p>
  <p class="label">Last updated 13 November 2026</p>
</section>
